3 ↔ 1 → [2, 1, 3, 4, 5]

Largest (3) goes to 3rd last.

Result: [2, 1, 3, 4, 5]

Iteration 4

Compare & swap:
2 ↔ 1 → [1, 2, 3, 4, 5]

Largest (2) goes to 4th last.

Result: [1, 2, 3, 4, 5]

